  "concept": {
    "zh": "争分 · 四机分市竞价",
    "en": "Score race · Four rivals in a split market"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "十四块电池分四次转场。每次转场同时搬两块未取电池。云母和曜石在比分落后时会争抢芽芽的近处目标。27 回合内与 4 台对手争夺电池，每块 1 分。电池收完或时间到时，必须独占最高分。同格同时拾取时按计分板顺序轮换优先权，第 1 回合芽芽优先。 第 4, 9, 15, 21 回合结束时切换通道并转移未取的货物；占用的门当次保持开启。从容模式须用同一程序通过两张地图。 控制台的 A、B 调度表列出两局地形、货物、机器人起点和调闸坐标。",
    "en": "Four transfers reshape a market of fourteen batteries. Each transfer moves two unclaimed batteries together. When they fall behind, Mica and Obsidian contest targets near Sprout. Race 4 rivals over 27 turns. Each battery is worth one point. Be the sole leader when the batteries run out or time expires. Simultaneous claims rotate in scoreboard order, starting with Sprout on turn one. After turns 4, 9, 15, 21, gates change and unclaimed cargo is transferred. Occupied gates stay open for that shift. In Relaxed mode, win both maps with the same program. The A and B schedule cards include both maps, cargo, rival starts and gate coordinates."
  },
